diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,6 +1,12 @@
 # Changelog
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Fixed — Copilot setup scheduling compatibility
+- Made the extracted Copilot setup job independent of sibling-job outputs by selecting `ubuntu-latest` directly and removing its prerequisite-job dependency.
+- Exported conservative concurrency, heap, and toolchain defaults through a setup step while preserving the protected session preload block and the standalone resource-profile diagnostics.
+- Reduced the setup timeout to the documented Copilot maximum of 59 minutes.
+- Hosted-session verification remains required; this patch does not claim a successful rerun or automatic larger-runner escalation.
+
 ### Fixed — Copilot runtime resource exhaustion (2026-10-05)
 - Added a resource preflight before Copilot environment setup that detects memory, CPU, and process headroom, caps worker counts, serializes dependency-graph work, and bounds the Node heap and native thread counts.
